{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-locally-projective-proper}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e8e689a5784b0e77aaaa9afec4757b719d991332fe0a635e488417c2c6944028", "source_text": "A locally projective morphism is proper.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:535dd114bd992d3239323d2f4340555205f5df81cb88b3e62f45de6c7d0a1597", "unit_id": "tag:01WC:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$X \\to \\mathbf{P}^n_S$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_S \\to S$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_S \\to S$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_{\\mathbf{Z}} \\to \\Spec(\\mathbf{Z})$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_{\\mathbf{Z}} \\to \\Spec(\\mathbf{Z})$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_{\\mathbf{Z}}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_{\\mathbf{Z}}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_{\\mathbf{Z}} \\to \\Spec(\\mathbf{Z})$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_{\\mathbf{Z}}$", "MATH_0012": "$D_{+}(X_i)$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathbf{Z}$", "MATH_0014": "$$\n\\mathbf{Z}[X_0/X_i, \\ldots, X_n/X_i].\n$$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathbf{P}^n_{\\mathbf{Z}} \\to \\Spec(\\mathbf{Z})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-proper-local-on-the-base}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-locally-projective}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-composition-proper}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-closed-immersion-proper}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-proper}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-proj-separated}", "REF_0007": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-proj-quasi-compact}", "REF_0008": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-proj-valuative-criterion}", "REF_0009": "\\ref{schemes-proposition-characterize-universally-closed}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b67c3abb7084dc76223e4290c574f5f4fef9a986f9200ae73271975c615c7537", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4ab1226abbb9908ac7cc857ec14903fb7d77ddb399f91da0716862af396dc575", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be locally projective.\nIn order to show that <MATH_0002> is proper we may work locally on the\nbase, see Lemma <REF_0001>.\nHence, by Lemma <REF_0002>\nabove we may assume there exists a closed immersion <MATH_0003>.\nBy Lemmas <REF_0003>\nand <REF_0004> it suffices to prove that\n<MATH_0004> is proper. Since\n<MATH_0005> is the base change of\n<MATH_0006> it suffices\nto show that <MATH_0007>\nis proper, see Lemma <REF_0005>.\nBy Constructions, Lemma <REF_0006> the scheme\n<MATH_0008> is separated.\nBy Constructions, Lemma <REF_0007> the scheme\n<MATH_0009> is quasi-compact.\nIt is clear that <MATH_0010>\nis locally of finite type since <MATH_0011> is\ncovered by the affine opens <MATH_0012> each of which is the\nspectrum of the finite type <MATH_0013>-algebra\n<MATH_0014>\nFinally, we have to show that\n<MATH_0015>\nis universally closed. This follows from\nConstructions, Lemma <REF_0008>\nand the valuative criterion (see Schemes,\nProposition <REF_0009>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b03249a4e9e0422284c8ba6482152bd90884ffd031588f1aa410a2a29348f73f", "unit_id": "tag:01WC:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-proper-ample-locally-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:247ec482550e89f680cc1dd27e209007d983eaf05b6eca431d2bb76631f2eae5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7c9a6417ed81ad04a5c8e10177fced436e01c1c1e9315913150bbb8550d8f30b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a proper morphism of schemes. If there exists\nan <MATH_0002>-ample invertible sheaf on <MATH_0003>, then <MATH_0004> is locally projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0d736c67daf78d25c0966f991b3fec9f01ed5b7a8954f07f5631ecb09ddaa24a", "unit_id": "tag:0B5N:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$i : X \\to \\mathbf{P}^n_S$", "MATH_0004": "$X \\to S$", "MATH_0005": "$i$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-finite-type-over-affine-ample-very-ample}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-image-proper-scheme-closed}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a382f83006ac623bda3257688a3812c419823c6909e9169f3f7832b3597edd57", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e773e491d00120c09aca7746cce707881ccf19e568fd4672812c0fcedce1d7aa", "source_text": "If there exists an <MATH_0001>-ample invertible sheaf, then we can locally\non <MATH_0002> find an immersion <MATH_0003>, see\nLemma <REF_0001>. Since <MATH_0004>\nis proper the morphism <MATH_0005> is a closed immersion, see\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:75836308945d376719c098f4300aff2641e568a3c71337d5ab2a30bf36884066", "unit_id": "tag:0B5N:proof"}
